Consider the main method shown above. Suppose `data.dat` contains: `"121 33 404"`. What is the output of the code?

```java
public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException
{
    Scanner f = new Scanner(new File("data.dat"));
    int x = 0;
    for(int i = 3;i<=5;i++)
    {
        x += f.nextInt(i);
    }
    out.println(x);
}
```
